=TITLE History Troupe

=SUBTITLE Preserve the history of the Raku project

=head1 Purpose

The History Troupe preserves and records the history of Raku

=head1 Activities

The things we do are:

=item Collect historical material about Raku (both in the CCR project below, and 
in the Timeline on the L<History page of this website|../../history/index>.  

=item Remaster any outdated material

=item Research and write new historical material

=head1 Resources

=head2 Code Repositories

The L<Raku Collect, Conserve and Remaster Project|https://raku.github.io/CCR/> 
website is in the repo at L<https://github.com/Raku/CCR>.  

The L<History section of this website>

